---
name: St Germain Spritz
ingredients:
  - type: St Germain
    amount: '1.5'
    unit: oz
    garnish: false
  - type: Sparkling wine
    amount: '2'
    unit: oz
    garnish: false
  - type: Sparkling water/club soda
    amount: '2'
    unit: oz
    garnish: false
  - type: Lemon
    amount: '1'
    unit: twist
    garnish: true
category:
  - sparkling
image: ../../images/cocktails/st-germain-spritz/image.jpg
sourceUrl: https://www.stgermainliqueur.com/us/en/cocktails/st-germain-spritz/
---
1. Pour sparkling wine and sparkling water over ice into your glass.
1. Top with St Germain.
1. Give the drink a good stir.
1. Gently twist a lemon peel on top of your drink.
